{"qid": "b05", "family": "b", "split": "dev", "method": "M3", "model": "glm", "answer": {"method": "M3", "model": "glm", "final": {"answer": "Yes. According to the Georg Fischer Type 165 2/2-way Solenoid Valve datasheet (which covers GV-1-1, GV-1-2 and GV-2-2), the valve is equipped with a 'service-friendly, robust manual override' (datasheet p. 1), and the product description on p. 3 shows the manual override as component 10 of the valve. The datasheet does not state any limitations on using the manual override without power, only that it is a servo-controlled 2/2-way diaphragm valve requiring a minimum differential pressure of 0.5 bar to open and close.", "not_present": false}, "outcome": "ANSWERED", "route": ["context_rag+chunks"], "cypher": [], "sources": [{"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "pages": [36, 1, 3]}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "pages": [1, 3, 4]}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "pages": [42, 34, 47, 98]}, {"document_id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52", "pages": [10, 1]}], "latency_s": 12.691802399989683, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 11528, "completion_tokens": 1807, "cost_usd": 0.00026224289999999997, "spent_usd": 0.0002619829, "n_calls": 2, "n_cached": 1, "models": ["qwen/qwen3-embedding-8b", "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash"]}, "trace": {"chunks": [{"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 36, "score": 0.679}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "page": 1, "score": 0.5949}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "page": 3, "score": 0.594}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 42, "score": 0.5761}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "page": 4, "score": 0.5742}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 34, "score": 0.5624}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 1, "score": 0.5586}, {"document_id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52", "page": 10, "score": 0.5533}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 3, "score": 0.5528}, {"document_id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52", "page": 1, "score": 0.5487}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 47, "score": 0.5465}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 98, "score": 0.5447}], "prompt_chars": 32116, "reply": "{\"answer\": \"Yes. According to the Georg Fischer Type 165 2/2-way Solenoid Valve datasheet (which covers GV-1-1, GV-1-2 and GV-2-2), the valve is equipped with a 'service-friendly, robust manual override' (datasheet p. 1), and the product description on p. 3 shows the manual override as component 10 of the valve. The datasheet does not state any limitations on using the manual override without power, only that it is a servo-controlled 2/2-way diaphragm valve requiring a minimum differential pressure of 0.5 bar to open and close.\", \"not_present\": false}"}}}
